  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "It's over, Tomimi.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "text": "...N-No it's not!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "text": "Nurul, Peta!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Doctor!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "Doctor!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "text": "If you don't want your friends getting hurt...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Don't make me angry, Tomimi!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "text": "...I won't stop until you promise you'll stay, Gavial!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Help me, Doctor!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "Doctor, I'm scared... Waaahhh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Did you finish your task?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dylan",
              "text": "Doctor, please. The girl's pouring her heart out here, it wouldn't kill you to work with her.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
              "text": "The people here are simple. Honestly, it hurts my non-existent robot heart to cheat them so.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dylan",
              "text": "Hey now, Doctor, don't look at me like that.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dylan",
              "text": "Relax, I'm a Rhodes Island Operator too. Of course I can handle something like this.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Don't be scared! I'm going to save you!",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
              "text": "Doctor!",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Lancet-2!",
          "value": "4",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Tomimi",
              "text": "What?",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Archosauria",
              "text": "When did you get free?!",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dylan",
              "text": "Hah. Sorry, somebody needs to learn to tie a knot.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "Did you know Tomimi was going to do this, Doctor?",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "Doctor!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dylan",
          "text": "Wow, you two are really selling it.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Of course.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Well, duh.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "B-B-But how did you know?",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Well, first of all, there was the way you hesitated when Zumama came up.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Oh? Hesitated?",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "And then when you panicked at Gavial during the ceremony.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Finally, Dylan, the thing?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dylan",
          "text": "Oh, I gave it to Lancet-2.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "Wahhh... That was just for you, Doctor. I don't normally let people put things inside me so easily.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "It's... a rocket launcher?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dylan",
          "text": "Yep. Found it with Tomimi's tribe.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "So that means...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dylan",
          "text": "You got it. The one who shot us down was this little runt right here.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Tomimi.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Ohhhhh, I'm sorry, Gavial.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Come here.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "(Whimper)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "You're going over my knee.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Gavial, please don't spank me, I know what I did was bad...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Them's the breaks.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Naughty little whelps get tail spankings!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "(Whimper)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceobe",
          "text": "Tail spanking, huh? Looks ouchie...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Are you going to do it again?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "I won't do it agaaain! Waaahhh...!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Good.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Anyway, I think we're pretty much okay now, Doctor.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Exhausting.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "Haha, well, it's definitely been a lot.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "Hey, Doctor, you're not falling asleep on your feet there, are you?",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "I'm surprised you didn't give her the whatever whirlwind thing.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "I wouldn't want to hurt little Tomimi, after all. Phew, I'm a little tired myself.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "This big guy... does look a little ugly at first, but the angular, rugged design, this cluttered but effective wiring, it has a special beauty to it when you look close.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "Real marriage material, I think.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Oh, Lancet-2, go see if we can still salvage the engine.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "What? Are you telling me the engine's inside this big guy?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Sure is. And we blew it up.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "Oh, poor engine. Poor big guy.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "Mr. Dylan, can you do me a favor?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dylan",
          "text": "Alright.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Hey, Zumama, why are you standing there drooling like that?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "Gavial!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Huh? What's up?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "That... that...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "What what?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "That... that moving, talking machine is incredible!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Oh, you mean Lancet-2? She's a friend of ours.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "C-Can I talk to her?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Knock yourself out.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "Erm... Hello.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "Hi?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "Are you... a machine?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "My product designation is Raythean Exister-S62 Model six-wheeled operation platform. I belong to Rhodes Island, codename Lancet-2.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "Wow!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "Yes. I do have a certain level of intelligence. As long as your questions aren't too hard, I should be able to answer them.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "Speaking of which, I am a medical operation platform, so my knowledge base is focused on medicine. Do keep that in mind.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "^%&$*#(#......! ! !",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "Is something wrong?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "Can I hug you?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "What?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "What is she doing? Did a screw come loose?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Isn't it obvious? She's in awe of that machine.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Oh?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Shocked as she was when she first saw a moving city, a machine that moves and talks on its own is even more striking!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "And forget her, I'm just as excited!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Oh, my beautiful young lady, might I have the honor of taking you on a date?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "I know the most gorgeous spot in the rainforest. I'll take you there for a lovely afternoon!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "Oh, y-you're asking me out?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "I don't know what to do here. I'm flattered... Doctor, should I accept?",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Yes.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Eunectes",
              "text": "Don't butt in, High Priest, or you can't blame me for what happens to our friendship after all these years.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "text": "Honestly, I'm with the Doctor here.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "text": "Kinda wanna laugh.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "I'll never let you take my Lancet-2!",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
              "text": "Oh, Doctor, to hear you suddenly come out and say that... My heart isn't ready...",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "So Gavial, your people you're with now can create this type of machine?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Huh? Err, I'm pretty sure Closure can, yeah.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "Okay. I've made a decision.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "Does this Rhodes Island place need more hands? I want to join.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Oh?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "I want to go with you, to learn about mechanical technology.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Huh?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "I've thought about leaving to go study in the outside world before, but I never seriously considered it because of the tribe. I think this is a great opportunity.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Th-Then I'm going too!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "What?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "If this is how it's going to be, then it's time for plan B... I'm going with Gavial!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Gavial, I fight really hard. I can definitely help you, Gavial!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Err, Doctor, what should I do here?",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "They can come, but I don't know what might happen.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "Yeah. Might as well give them the operator tests.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "C'mon, Doctor, be nice.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "You made your bed, now lie in it.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "Doooctooor!",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Whatever. At least stick with the Doctor and try to learn something.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Right!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Hey, Gavial, do me a favor and tell me what this little squirt is saying.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Flint",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Huh? Kemar?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Flint",
          "text": "I have to go with her.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "She says she's going with you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Oh. Cool. She packs a punch. I bet she'll make a fine operator.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "She said okay.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Flint",
          "text": "Good.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Hm? Wait a second. So Zumama's going, Tomimi's going, and Kemar's going, what about the tribes?",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "You weren't worried about that when you left the first time.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Ahahaha, I was seeing red back then! Couldn't think at all.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "You're right, though... I can't just abandon my tribe.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Oh, I think you've got nothing to worry about in that department.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "text": "It's no Gavial, but the Big Ugly is still pretty strong.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
          "text": "That's for sure. I want to make one too.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
          "text": "With the Temple destroyed, let's build machines instead. Whoever makes the most awesome one gets to be Great Chief?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria D",
          "text": "Hey, no! Fighting is way better!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
          "text": "Oh, good point. I don't want to give up fighting. What should we do?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "text": "All right, morons. Why not just fight and also build machines?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Group of Archosauria",
          "text": "Yeah!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "See? Nothing to worry about at all.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "From what I've seen, the common folk are usually quick to adapt, even as the leaders hem and haw about the future.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "What if I told you the first Great Chief was actually a Tiacauh Brave who gave himself the title, prior to whom there was no custom to choose a Great Chief at all?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "...High Priest, why did you never tell me that before?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Oh, I never thought it was important. Is it? My point is that people are resilient, they'll go on living even if one of their traditions disappears.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "I've always thought of traditions as rituals that bring people together.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "But when that tradition carries on for a few decades, they start to think it's inviolable, it's unbreakable, it has to go on forever.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "But that's nonsense!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "So you tell me you want to blow up the Temple and I'm all in, both hands, both feet, and my tail too!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Oh, no, if my hands and feet are in, my tail has to stay out... right? What if I'm laying down? Let's see!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "...I get it.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Just how old are you?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "How old? I forget.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "And honestly, these methods you have for keeping track of time mean nothing to me! Whether or not I happen to have forgotten when I was born!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "O...kay. But we still need someone to be the Great Chief.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Inam",
          "text": "Hey, I heard Gavial and Zumama were fighting again. Is it already over?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Hmm...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Inam",
          "text": "Why are you looking at me like that, Gavial?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Say, Inam, are you interested in being Great Chief at all?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Inam",
          "text": "What?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "So after going through all that, you got the engine back, performed your emergency repairs, and got on the road back home?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Y-Yeah!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Doctor, I do believe I told you what a precious piece of equipment that aircraft was before you left.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "There were extenuating circumstances.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Wasn't my fault.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Seeing as the aircraft is still in reparable condition, I won't be too hard on you. But the maintenance costs are coming out of your pay, and Blaze's.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Aww, and mine...?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "An elite operator takes elite responsibility.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Agh, fine.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "As for the three individuals you brought back, since you seem to think they have what it takes to be operators, I'll leave them to the Doctor.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Gavial, were you satisfied with your trip back home?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Huh? Sure. But even I didn't think it'd go down like that. It was fun.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Honestly, I had a contingency plan in case the Doctor didn't bring you back.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Why?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Because I figured there was a possibility you'd want to stay there.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Huh? Kal'tsit, I thought you knew me better than that.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "You've never really adapted to life outside your tribe. Every day, you come into conflict with the world, in your own ferocious way.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "I'll put it this way: if someday you asked for a leave of absence, or if you just left, I wouldn't be surprised.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Hey, Doctor, maybe I'm not getting this right. Is Kal'tsit saying she cares about me?",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Yes.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
              "text": "If there's nothing else, Dr. {@nickname}, you can go.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "Tch, yeah, this is one of those times the Doctor likes to play dead.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "Then I'm gonna go ahead and say you care about me.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Maybe.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "That's our Kal'tsit, even confusing the Doctor.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Kal'tsit, I'm not going anywhere.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "I had a reason to leave my tribe. I really did want to practice medicine.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Now that's not to say I really thought I could become a doctor, but I'm very happy I made that decision.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "From a modern medical standpoint, we pretty much have no doctors back home. If you get sick, you just let it run its course. Maybe try a few traditional remedies.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "If I never left, I wouldn't know what the world is really like.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "I wouldn't know how many diseases are preventable or curable, I wouldn't know how people look down on Oripathy. I wouldn't know that saving lives makes me as happy as taking them.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "The world is definitely complicated, and I don't always know what motivates people, or why they fight.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "But I'm a doctor now. And my dream is to treat Oripathy.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Is there a better place in this wide world for me to study and practice medicine?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "I'm afraid not.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Well how about that. And by the way, you all work a lot harder than I do. What's with you here worrying about me?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Honestly, I think I should be worrying about you, Kal'tsit.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "You didn't pick up my slack while I was away now, did you?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "No.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Good. I'm gonna give Zumama an Oripathy checkup. You have a nice chat now.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Oh, I'll see what Kemar's up to. Err, I guess I'm calling her Flint now. I'm worried she'll get into a fight, with the language barrier and all...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Doctor, Tomimi should be in her general studies class now. You check on her when you're done.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Gavial.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Hm?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Welcome back.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Haha.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Hey! What about me?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "You had another mission ready to go last week. You're technically very late.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Oh...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "In your eyes, you just went on a nonsensical journey.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "But, just like our Gavial, it was a showcase of the lively and diverse world we inhabit.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "We lose so much to the endless march of time. That which was once a fact of life in the past is now precious to us.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "We search for the light that slips through the breaks in the crowd and begin to see that as the norm.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "I hope you and your fellow operators learned a lesson from this trip: some things are not too far out of reach.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "text": "Kal'tsit, meeting time!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "I know.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Now then, Dr. {@nickname}, you have a lot of work waiting for you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "I hope you got enough rest on your vacation.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
